            <div xml:id="d281">

                <pb facs="0429" n="335" xml:id="pg335"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.00/835: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Liberia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Hall</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Paraphrase]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Monrovia</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1930-07-14T12:00:00-00:44">July 14,
                        1930—noon</date>.<lb/>[Received 2:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>97. My 88, June 25, 4 p.m. I hear the documents have been shown by the Liberian
                    representative, Sottile, at Geneva. General distribution has occurred in
                    Liberia.</p>
                <p>Secretary Barclay has published the denial by me of their authenticity.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hall</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
